N5008 [over.match.oper]/3.3 (non-member candidate set ignores member functions)
+ [basic.lookup.argdep]/2 (a reference argument's associated types are those of
the referenced type).  A free function-template operator<<(basic_ostream<C>&,
const char*) hidden from ordinary lookup by an enclosing member operator<< must
still be found via ADL on the reference-typed left operand and deduced/selected.
The `const char *` half of the dog-food src/util (parse_options.cpp,
typecheck.cpp) shl noise.  assertion.2 ("WRONG") must FAIL (non-vacuity).
